 "An insurer in Nairobi answers claims by phone. Frames of sound run down a line of stages, and each one spends time.": "0b17e2673d.mp3",
 "If every stage waits for the last, the caller hears silence. Stream partial frames and the first word comes in time.": "24e79e32a7.mp3",
 "Deciding that someone has stopped speaking is itself a model. A pause is not always the end of a thought.": "b741d761fb.mp3",
